---
layout: layouts/app.njk
title: "Mi seguimiento"
description: "Espacio privado de seguimiento nutricional."
permalink: /mi-seguimiento/
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
manifest: /mi-seguimiento/manifest.webmanifest
appleTouchIcon: /img/mi-seguimiento/apple-touch-180.png
appleTitle: "CLN"
styles:
  - /mi-seguimiento/app.css
---

<div class="ms-page">
  <p class="ms-brand"><a href="/">Cris Lorente Nutrición</a></p>

  <aside id="ms-install-hint" class="ms-install-hint" role="note" aria-label="Instalar en pantalla de inicio">
    <button type="button" class="ms-ih-close" aria-label="Cerrar" data-ms-ih-close>×</button>
    <strong>Añade Mi seguimiento a tu pantalla de inicio.</strong><br>
    Toca el botón <strong>Compartir</strong> abajo y luego <strong>“Añadir a pantalla de inicio”</strong>.
  </aside>

  {# ============================== LOADING VIEW (boot) ============================== #}
  <section id="ms-loading" class="ms-loading" aria-live="polite" aria-busy="true">
    <svg class="ms-loading-sprig" viewBox="0 0 80 80" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
      <path d="M40 72 Q40 44 40 12" pathLength="100"/>
      <path d="M40 55 Q27 51 19 36" pathLength="100"/>
      <path d="M40 46 Q53 43 61 27" pathLength="100"/>
      <path d="M40 35 Q29 32 24 18" pathLength="100"/>
      <path d="M40 27 Q52 25 58 13" pathLength="100"/>
      <circle cx="40" cy="10" r="1.8" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
    </svg>
    <div class="ms-loading-msgs">
      <p class="ms-loading-msg is-visible">Preparando tu espacio…</p>
      <p class="ms-loading-msg">Abriendo el diario de hoy…</p>
      <p class="ms-loading-msg">Casi listo, un momento…</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  {# ============================== LOGIN VIEW ============================== #}
  <section id="ms-login" class="ms-login" hidden>
    <svg class="ms-sprig" viewBox="0 0 80 80" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
      <path d="M40 72 Q40 44 40 12"/>
      <path d="M40 55 Q27 51 19 36"/>
      <path d="M40 46 Q53 43 61 27"/>
      <path d="M40 35 Q29 32 24 18"/>
      <path d="M40 27 Q52 25 58 13"/>
      <circle cx="40" cy="10" r="1.8" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
    </svg>

    <h1 id="ms-login-title" class="ms-login-title">Tu <em>espacio</em><br>de seguimiento</h1>
    <p id="ms-login-intro" class="ms-login-intro">
      Aquí ves tu menú de hoy, marcas cómo te ha ido el día y observas cómo avanzas semana a semana. Sin contraseñas: escribes tu correo, te llega un código de 6 dígitos, lo escribes y entras.
    </p>

    <aside id="ms-welcome-back" class="ms-welcome-back" hidden aria-live="polite">
      <p class="ms-welcome-back-title">Bienvenida de nuevo, <em id="ms-welcome-back-name">…</em></p>
      <p class="ms-welcome-back-msg">Por seguridad te pedimos entrar otra vez. Te mandamos un código a tu correo y sigues donde lo dejaste.</p>
      <button type="button" id="ms-welcome-back-forget" class="ms-welcome-back-forget">No soy yo, usar otro correo</button>
    </aside>

    <form id="ms-login-form" class="ms-login-form" novalidate>
      <label for="ms-email" class="ms-label">Tu correo</label>
      <input
        id="ms-email"
        name="email"
        type="email"
        required
        class="ms-input"
        placeholder="tunombre@correo.com"
        autocomplete="email"
        inputmode="email"
      >
      <label class="ms-consent" for="ms-consent">
        <input id="ms-consent" type="checkbox" class="ms-consent-box" required>
        <span>Acepto el tratamiento de mis datos según la <a href="/privacidad-seguimiento/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">política de privacidad de la zona de seguimiento</a>.</span>
      </label>
      <button type="submit" id="ms-login-submit" class="ms-submit">
        <svg class="ms-btn-spinner" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke-dasharray="20 45"/></svg>
        <span class="ms-submit-label">Enviar código</span>
      </button>
      <p class="ms-login-hint">Revisa tu bandeja de entrada (y spam, por si acaso).</p>
    </form>

    <p id="ms-status" class="ms-status" hidden></p>

    <form id="ms-otp-form" class="ms-login-form" novalidate hidden>
      <label for="ms-otp-code" class="ms-label">Código de 6 dígitos</label>
      <input
        id="ms-otp-code"
        name="code"
        type="text"
        class="ms-input"
        inputmode="numeric"
        autocomplete="one-time-code"
        maxlength="6"
        pattern="\d{6}"
        placeholder="123456"
        aria-describedby="ms-otp-hint"
      >
      <button type="submit" id="ms-otp-submit" class="ms-submit">
        <svg class="ms-btn-spinner" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke-dasharray="20 45"/></svg>
        <span class="ms-submit-label">Entrar</span>
      </button>
      <p id="ms-otp-hint" class="ms-login-hint">Lo encontrarás en el correo que acabamos de enviarte.</p>
    </form>

    <p class="ms-login-foot">Solo pacientes de Cris Lorente Nutrición.</p>
  </section>

  {# ============================== AUTHED VIEW ============================== #}
  <section id="ms-authed" class="ms-authed" data-view="today" hidden>
    <header class="ms-hero">
      <div class="ms-hero-text">
        <p class="ms-eyebrow" id="ms-date"><span class="sk-line sk-line--eyebrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></p>
        <h1 class="ms-greeting"><span id="ms-greeting-word">Buenos días</span>, <em id="ms-name"><span class="sk-line sk-line--name" aria-hidden="true"></span></em></h1>
      </div>
      <div class="ms-streak" aria-label="Racha de días seguidos">
        <svg class="ms-flame" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M12 2c.4 3.2 3 4.5 3 8 0 1.6-.9 3-2.2 3.7.4-1.4-.2-2.7-1.3-3.4.2 2.3-2.5 3-2.5 5.7 0 2.4 2 4 5 4s5-1.9 5-4.5c0-4.9-4.2-6.7-7-13.5z" fill="currentColor"/>
        </svg>
        <span class="ms-streak-num" id="ms-streak-num"><span class="sk-line sk-line--streak" aria-hidden="true"></span></span>
        <span class="ms-streak-label">días</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    {# Revisión mensual: CTA persistente (oculto por defecto, se renderiza al hidratar) #}
    <aside id="ms-revision-cta" class="ms-revision-cta" data-state="hidden" hidden>
      <div class="ms-revision-cta-body">
        <span class="ms-revision-cta-eyebrow">revisión mensual</span>
        <p id="ms-revision-cta-msg" class="ms-revision-cta-msg">—</p>
      </div>
      <a id="ms-revision-cta-action" class="ms-revision-cta-btn" href="/mi-seguimiento/revision/">Enviar revisión mensual</a>
    </aside>

    <section class="ms-today" aria-labelledby="ms-today-title">
      <button type="button" class="ms-back-today" id="ms-back-today">← volver a hoy</button>
      <h2 id="ms-today-title" class="ms-section-title"><span id="ms-today-label">hoy</span></h2>
      <ol class="ms-meals" id="ms-meals">
        <li class="ms-meal is-skeleton"><span class="ms-meal-time">Desayuno</span><p class="ms-meal-text" aria-label="Cargando menú"><span class="sk-line sk-line--meal" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="sk-line sk-line--meal sk-line--meal-short" aria-hidden="true"></span></p></li>
        <li class="ms-meal is-skeleton"><span class="ms-meal-time">Almuerzo</span><p class="ms-meal-text" aria-hidden="true"><span class="sk-line sk-line--meal"></span><span class="sk-line sk-line--meal sk-line--meal-short"></span></p></li>
        <li class="ms-meal is-skeleton"><span class="ms-meal-time">Comida</span><p class="ms-meal-text" aria-hidden="true"><span class="sk-line sk-line--meal"></span><span class="sk-line sk-line--meal sk-line--meal-short"></span></p></li>
        <li class="ms-meal is-skeleton"><span class="ms-meal-time">Merienda</span><p class="ms-meal-text" aria-hidden="true"><span class="sk-line sk-line--meal"></span><span class="sk-line sk-line--meal sk-line--meal-short"></span></p></li>
        <li class="ms-meal is-skeleton"><span class="ms-meal-time">Cena</span><p class="ms-meal-text" aria-hidden="true"><span class="sk-line sk-line--meal"></span><span class="sk-line sk-line--meal sk-line--meal-short"></span></p></li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <p class="ms-tip" id="ms-tip" hidden></p>

    <section class="ms-check" aria-labelledby="ms-check-title">
      <h2 id="ms-check-title" class="ms-section-title"><span id="ms-check-label">¿cómo ha ido hoy?</span></h2>
      <div class="ms-check-status" id="ms-check-status"></div>
      <div class="ms-check-btns" id="ms-check-btns" role="group" aria-label="Check-in del día">
        <button type="button" class="ms-check-btn ms-check-ok"  data-estado="seguido">
          <span class="ms-check-emoji" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span>
          <span class="ms-check-label">Lo he seguido</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="ms-check-btn ms-check-mid" data-estado="parcial">
          <span class="ms-check-emoji" aria-hidden="true">~</span>
          <span class="ms-check-label">A medias</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="ms-check-btn ms-check-no"  data-estado="no">
          <span class="ms-check-emoji" aria-hidden="true">×</span>
          <span class="ms-check-label">Hoy no</span>
        </button>
      </div>
      <p class="ms-check-hint">«A medias» mantiene la racha. Solo «hoy no» la reinicia.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="ms-calendar" aria-labelledby="ms-month-title">
      <h2 id="ms-month-title" class="ms-section-title"><span id="ms-month">este mes</span></h2>
      <div class="ms-calendar-weekdays" aria-hidden="true">
        <span>L</span><span>M</span><span>X</span><span>J</span><span>V</span><span>S</span><span>D</span>
      </div>
      <div class="ms-calendar-grid" id="ms-calendar-grid" aria-label="Calendario del mes">
        {# Celdas shimmer. renderCalendar() las reemplaza en cuanto llegan los checkins. #}
        {% for i in range(0, 35) %}
        <span class="ms-cal-cell is-loading" style="--sk-delay: {{ i * 40 }}ms" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      <p class="ms-calendar-legend">
        <span><span class="ms-legend-dot is-ok"></span>lo seguí</span>
        <span><span class="ms-legend-dot is-mid"></span>a medias</span>
        <span><span class="ms-legend-dot is-no"></span>hoy no</span>
      </p>
    </section>

    {# ============================== LISTA DE LA COMPRA — view (se abre desde la barra de pestañas) ============================== #}
    <section class="ms-compra" id="ms-compra" aria-labelledby="ms-compra-title">
      <h2 id="ms-compra-title" class="ms-section-title"><span>la compra de esta semana</span></h2>
      <p class="ms-compra-progress" id="ms-compra-progress">—</p>
      <div class="ms-compra-cats" id="ms-compra-cats"></div>
      <div class="ms-compra-actions" id="ms-compra-actions" hidden>
        <button type="button" class="ms-compra-reset" id="ms-compra-reset" aria-label="Reiniciar lista y desmarcar todos los productos">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M21 12a9 9 0 1 1-3.3-6.95"/>
            <path d="M21 4v5h-5"/>
          </svg>
          <span>Reiniciar lista</span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </section>

    {# ===== Vista Aprender (se abre desde la barra de pestañas) ===== #}
    <section class="ms-aprender" aria-label="Aprender">
      <h2 class="ms-section-title">Aprender</h2>
      <p class="ms-sub">Completa las lecciones y desbloquea tu guía.</p>
      <div class="ms-apr-top">
        <div class="ms-apr-stat"><b id="ms-apr-stat-lecciones">0/10</b><small>lecciones</small></div>
        <div class="ms-apr-stat"><b id="ms-apr-stat-guias">0/3</b><small>guías</small></div>
      </div>
      <div id="ms-apr-reto" hidden></div>
      <div id="ms-apr-mapa"></div>
    </section>

    <footer class="ms-foot">
      <a href="#" id="ms-pdf-link" class="ms-pdf-link" hidden>Descargar el menú en PDF</a>
      <button type="button" class="ms-signout" id="ms-signout">Cerrar sesión</button>
    </footer>
  </section>

  {# ===== Barra de pestañas fija inferior — navegación entre vistas.
     Fuera de #ms-authed a propósito: su ms-fade-in (transform) rompería el
     position:fixed. La visibilidad la deriva el CSS con body:has(). ===== #}
  <nav class="ms-tabbar" aria-label="Secciones de tu espacio">
      <div class="ms-tabbar-inner">
        <button type="button" class="ms-tab" data-tab="today" aria-current="page">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M3 10.5 12 3l9 7.5"/>
            <path d="M5 9.5V21h14V9.5"/>
          </svg>
          <span>Hoy</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="ms-tab" data-tab="compra">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M3 4h2l2.6 11.2a2 2 0 0 0 2 1.6h7.9a2 2 0 0 0 2-1.5L21 7H6"/>
            <circle cx="9.5" cy="20" r="1.3"/>
            <circle cx="17.5" cy="20" r="1.3"/>
          </svg>
          <span>Compra</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="ms-tab" id="ms-tab-aprender" data-tab="aprender" hidden>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20"/>
            <path d="M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2z"/>
          </svg>
          <span>Aprender</span>
        </button>
      </div>
  </nav>

  {# ============================== ONBOARDING MODAL ============================== #}
  <div id="ms-onboarding" class="ms-modal-backdrop" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="ms-modal-title" hidden>
    <div class="ms-modal">
      <h2 id="ms-modal-title" class="ms-modal-title">Bienvenida a <em>tu espacio</em></h2>
      <p class="ms-modal-intro">
        Un sitio pequeño y tuyo para ver cómo avanzas día a día. Así funciona:
      </p>
      <ul class="ms-modal-list">
        <li><span class="ms-modal-ico is-ok"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span><span>Al final del día marca cómo te ha ido: <strong>lo seguí</strong>, <strong>a medias</strong> o <strong>hoy no</strong>.</span></li>
        <li><span class="ms-modal-ico is-streak">🔥</span><span>Tu <strong>racha</strong> suma un día cada vez que marcas <strong>«lo seguí»</strong>. Con <strong>«a medias»</strong> se mantiene; con <strong>«hoy no»</strong> vuelve a cero.</span></li>
      </ul>
      <button type="button" class="ms-modal-ok" id="ms-modal-ok">Entendido, empezamos</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  {# ============================== MILESTONE MODAL ============================== #}
  <div id="ms-milestone" class="ms-modal-backdrop ms-milestone" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="ms-milestone-title" hidden>
    <div class="ms-modal">
      <span id="ms-milestone-emoji" class="ms-milestone-emoji" aria-hidden="true">🔥</span>
      <h2 id="ms-milestone-title" class="ms-milestone-title">Una <em>semana</em> seguida</h2>
      <p id="ms-milestone-msg" class="ms-milestone-msg">Siete días cuidándote. Esto ya no es casualidad.</p>
      <button type="button" class="ms-modal-ok" id="ms-milestone-ok">Seguimos</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  {# ============================== INSTALL TUTORIAL (A3) ============================== #}
  <div id="ms-install" class="ms-modal-backdrop" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="ms-install-title" aria-live="polite" hidden>
    <div class="ms-modal">
      <h2 id="ms-install-title" class="ms-modal-title">Tenlo a <em>un toque</em></h2>
      <p class="ms-modal-intro" id="ms-install-intro">
        Añádelo a tu pantalla de inicio y entras directo, sin buscar nada.
      </p>
      <div id="ms-install-body"></div>
      <div class="ms-modal-actions">
        <button type="button" class="ms-modal-ok" id="ms-install-ok">Ya lo tengo</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {# ============================== IN-APP BROWSER WARN (A4) ============================== #}
  <div id="ms-inapp" class="ms-modal-backdrop" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="ms-inapp-title" aria-live="polite" hidden>
    <div class="ms-modal">
      <h2 id="ms-inapp-title" class="ms-modal-title">Ábrelo en <em>tu navegador</em></h2>
      <p class="ms-modal-intro" id="ms-inapp-intro">
        Para guardar esta página como app en tu móvil, ábrela en Safari o Chrome.
      </p>
      <div class="ms-modal-actions">
        <button type="button" class="ms-modal-ok" id="ms-inapp-action">Abrir en Chrome</button>
        <button type="button" class="ms-modal-secondary" id="ms-inapp-dismiss">Ahora no</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {# ============================== RESET COMPRA MODAL ============================== #}
  <div id="ms-compra-reset-modal" class="ms-modal-backdrop" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="ms-compra-reset-title" hidden>
    <div class="ms-modal">
      <h2 id="ms-compra-reset-title" class="ms-modal-title">¿Empezar <em>de cero</em>?</h2>
      <p class="ms-modal-intro" id="ms-compra-reset-intro">
        Se desmarcarán todos los productos de esta lista.
      </p>
      <div class="ms-modal-actions">
        <button type="button" class="ms-modal-ok" id="ms-compra-reset-ok">Sí, reiniciar</button>
        <button type="button" class="ms-modal-secondary" id="ms-compra-reset-cancel">Dejarla como está</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {# ============================== INTERCAMBIADOR — MODAL ============================== #}
  <div id="ms-opcion-modal" class="ms-modal-backdrop" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="ms-opcion-title" hidden>
    <div class="ms-modal">
      <h2 id="ms-opcion-title" class="ms-modal-title">Elige tu comida</h2>
      <p class="ms-modal-intro">Opciones equivalentes · se renuevan cada 15 días</p>
      <div class="ms-modal-list" id="ms-opcion-list"></div>
      <div class="ms-modal-actions">
        <button type="button" class="ms-modal-secondary" id="ms-opcion-cancel">Cerrar</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {# ============================== MENÚ NUEVO — MODAL ONE-SHOT ============================== #}
  <div id="ms-menu-nuevo-modal" class="ms-modal-backdrop" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="ms-menu-nuevo-title" hidden>
    <div class="ms-modal">
      <span class="ms-menu-nuevo-emoji" aria-hidden="true">✨</span>
      <h2 id="ms-menu-nuevo-title" class="ms-modal-title">Tu <em>nuevo menú</em> ya está listo</h2>
      <p id="ms-menu-nuevo-msg" class="ms-modal-intro">Cristina te ha preparado un menú nuevo. Aquí lo tienes para empezar hoy.</p>
      <button type="button" class="ms-modal-ok" id="ms-menu-nuevo-ok">Ver mi menú</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  {# ============================== REVISIÓN MENSUAL — MODAL ONE-SHOT ============================== #}
  <div id="ms-revision-modal" class="ms-modal-backdrop" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="ms-revision-modal-title" hidden>
    <div class="ms-modal">
      <h2 id="ms-revision-modal-title" class="ms-modal-title">¡Nos vemos <em>pronto</em>! 💚</h2>
      <p id="ms-revision-modal-body" class="ms-modal-intro">—</p>
      <div class="ms-modal-actions">
        <button type="button" class="ms-modal-ok" id="ms-revision-modal-go">Empezar revisión&nbsp;→</button>
        <button type="button" class="ms-modal-secondary" id="ms-revision-modal-later">Ahora no</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {# ============================== CURSO «APRENDER» — reproductor de lección ============================== #}
  <div id="ms-apr-player" class="ms-apr-player" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="Lección" hidden>
    <div class="ms-apr-player-top">
      <button type="button" class="ms-apr-player-x" id="ms-apr-player-close" aria-label="Cerrar sin guardar">✕</button>
      <div class="ms-apr-segs" id="ms-apr-segs"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="ms-apr-player-body" id="ms-apr-player-body"></div>
    <div class="ms-apr-player-nav">
      <button type="button" class="ms-apr-btn-prev" id="ms-apr-btn-prev">‹ atrás</button>
      <button type="button" class="ms-apr-btn-next" id="ms-apr-btn-next">Siguiente →</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  {# ============================== CURSO «APRENDER» — celebración ============================== #}
  <div id="ms-apr-celebrate" class="ms-apr-celebrate" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden>
    <div class="ms-apr-celebrate-ring">✓</div>
    <h3 id="ms-apr-celebrate-title">¡Módulo completado!</h3>
    <p id="ms-apr-celebrate-sub">Sigue así.</p>
  </div>

  {# ============================== CURSO «APRENDER» — desbloqueo de guía PDF ============================== #}
  <div id="ms-apr-pdf-modal" class="ms-apr-pdf-modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="Guía desbloqueada" hidden>
